A command-line application designed to simplify personal finance management.
It allows users to log expenses into a database by specifying the category, amount, and date. 
Users can generate structured PDF reports summarizing all recorded expenses for easy reference. 
The program also includes visual tools like bar graphs and pie charts.
Additionally, it calculates total monthly expenses, allowing users to monitor financial habits over time.

Prerequisites
To run the program, ensure the following are installed:
--->Python (version 3.7 or higher)
--->Required Python Libraries:
--->matplotlib
--->pandas
--->reportlab

Clone or Download the Program:
Link-->https://github.com/Nisha123-eng/CalculateExpenses
Clone the repository or download the code files to your local system.

